# Vercel upload ignore list.
#
# The repo contains very large trees that must never be uploaded to Vercel:
#   server/.mlvenv  — a Python venv with PyTorch (~8k files)
#   models/         — training images and datasets (thousands of files)
#   android/        — the Capacitor native project (built separately)
#
# `.vercelignore` is applied on top of `.gitignore`; both are needed.

node_modules
server/node_modules
server/.mlvenv
server/.venv
server/venv
models
android
ios
dist
.git
.github
.env.local
webapp-config.json
oauth-web-client.json
*.log
.DS_Store
**/.firebase
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
coverage
.vscode
.idea
